dentical (transcribed refusal and window-class readings, and the branch diff naming no layout value)\n- [x] screenshots of Option B on the row in both poses, never committed\n- [x] if iOS refuses the presentation, the row is BLOCKED with the documented refusal and no hacks"}}', NULL);
