ins the per-state colours; owner''s read)\n- [x] the reset control never renders black in any state on any platform (the text-ink sweep inside yarn validate bans alpha-0 text colour outright; no Text in app/ or components/ paints alpha 0)\n- [ ] on the home screen, both header labels read a muted blue-grey carrying a hint of purple - shifted from today''s too-purple ink a touch toward the blue of the band behind them; a minor touch, the owner''s read is the bar (Countdown and Day suites pin the home ink #7485b9)\n- [ ] with the overlay open, both labels sit closer to the overlay''s purple glow - a little greyer, a hint more purple, slightly less blue than today''s lavender; not a drastic change, the owner''s read is the bar (the same suites pin the overlay ink #7173bc and the interpolation endpoints)\n- [ ] the qibla sheet shows exactly one instruction line at a time: the wave line alone while the calibration runs, the settled line alone after it - the doubled darker text above it is gone, the owner''s read is the bar (Qibla.test.tsx pins the donor''s ink at the sheet solid)\n- [ ] Help''s widget question carries iOS and Android in bold in every shipped language - the owner''s read is the bar (help.test.ts and Help.test.tsx pin the split and the emphasis face across all six locales)\n- [x] yarn validate green"}}', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.issue_activity (id, issue_id, kind, actor_name, body, action, created_at, actor_user_id, initiative_id, reply_to_id, payload, edited_at) VALUES (3168, 322, 'comment', 'owner', 'Steps 3 and 4 are code-done and committed on lane/322 (2.4.20, 2.4.21): the two header labels carry their tuned inks (home #7485b9, overlay #7173bc) with Countdown''s name riding the overlay''s own progress and Day''s location riding the flag its masjid fade rides, and Help''s iOS and Android labels read bold in the emphasis face with the sentences regular, split at render time so the catalogs and the hash lock are untouched. The pins are red-first over all six locales, yarn validate is green at 100 percent coverage, and the owner''s glass reads on these two items join items 1, 2 and 6 in the closing phase.', NULL, '2026-10-24 13:36:29.567998+00', 'DFppJIU20ig1j5gFRYQIe541IkO7Itfp', NULL, NULL, '{}', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.issue_activity (id, issue_id, kind, actor_name, body, action, created_at, actor_user_id, initiative_id, reply_to_id, payload, edited_at) VALUES (3169, 322, 'comment', 'owner', 'Audit passed: the four commits match the plan step for step and carry nothing else - the backdrop constant with its derivation pin, the alpha-0 ban with the extended resolver, the plant proof and both defect sites converted, the two tuned header ink roles riding existing progress atoms, and Help''s render-time bold split with the six catalogs and the hash lock untouched. yarn validate is green in the worktree (232 suites, 5973 passed, 100 percent coverage), and the reset''s card-face constant recomputes exactly from the card wash over the sheet.

nitpick: the plan''s versioning ruling names android/app/build.gradle alongside the three files each commit bumps, but this repo tracks no android/ file (gitignored, prebuild derives build.gradle from app.json at build time), so the ruling as written is unmeetable; the commits bump every tracked version file, which is all it can mean here - no action needed.', NULL, '2026-10-24 13:44:30.069926+00', 'DFppJIU20ig1j5gFRYQIe541IkO7Itfp', NULL, NULL, '{}', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.issue_activity (id, issue_id, kind, actor_name, body, action, created_at, actor_user_id, initiative_id, reply_to_id, payload, edited_at) VALUES (3172, 322, 'comment', 'owner', 'The lane is audited and served to both phones as a production-compiled mock build at 2.4.22 (lane/322, 57df0840): the APK sits on the 3T as <pkg> versionCode 1000000, User 0 alone, and the same bundle sits on the iPhone XS over the dev line. Neither was launched - the glass is the owner''s. The read list sits in Waiting on; the lane branch and its worktree stay for the merge once the verdict lands.', NULL, '2026-10-24 14:12:58.3872+00', 'DFppJIU20ig1j5gFRYQIe541IkO7Itfp', NULL, NULL, '{}', NULL);
