INSERT INTO public.issue_activity (id, issue_id, kind, actor_name, body, action, created_at, actor_user_id, initiative_id, reply_to_id, payload, edited_at) VALUES (3287, 327, 'comment', 'owner', 'Step 3 done: the anchor bisect is measured, and the window that owns the regression is 887d7949..1c22014c (2.4.23..2.4.24).

Anchors measured (Release gate-ON, EXPO_PUBLIC_PERF_MONITOR=1, dev env; per anchor: prebuild + assembleRelease through the single slot, aapt2 badging asserted com.example.athan versionCode 1000000, adb install -r, User 0 alone, versionName checked, first post-install launch discarded, PERF_MEASURE verified flowing):

- 5b496afe (2.4.11): every entrance renders. Alert and settings first frames at 23.7% of travel with clean decelerating 15-18ms steps, overlay-open ramps 15 monotonic frames after a one-step content swap, overlay-close fades through nine graduated alphas. Tap-to-first-pixel 176-430ms (settings pinned at 319ms by the button''s on-screen ripple). No misses inside any motion.
- f97cd7d4 (2.4.17), 294 merged, the owner''s suspicion: same shape. First frames 22.7-24.5%, dead starts 195-650ms (alert worst), one 33ms hold at 96.4% on settings. The dead zone exists here in embryo but the entrance still draws.
- 887d7949 (2.4.23), 322 merged: same shape. First frames 23.7-24.0% (settings a 0.6%-residual ease-out, tap pinned at ~0.52s by the button press-scale, ~300ms dead zone), dead zones 215-490ms, worst in-motion stall 34ms.
- 1c22014c (2.4.24, the tip) re-measured tonight as the window''s only commit: the sheets'' entrances stop rendering. Settings first appears at 87.8% of travel (1432 of 1632px in one 17ms step, scrim arriving at 90% in the same frame); alert''s first frame is 42.6% (693px in 13.9ms, 3.1x the next step''s velocity) after a frozen stretch around half a second; overlay-open''s hole is 851ms and overlay-close sits frozen 815ms with a compressed first step. Same night, same driver, same verified tap points, battery 27-42% on charge: 2.4.23 renders, 2.4.24 snaps. Step 1''s severe tip readings (591-671ms holes, 96.4%/71% snaps) reproduce under controlled state.

Verdict: every build below the tip carries only a mild, version-invariant tap-adjacent latency (~0.2-0.5s, entrances fully drawn); the unrendered-entrance failure with enlarged holes enters inside 887d7949..1c22014c. That window holds exactly one first-parent commit, whose diff is version stamps (package.json, app.json), the board snapshot, and shared/whatsNew.ts''s version constant - no animation code. Step 4 should interrogate that commit''s only JS-visible change (the What''s New stamp and what a re-stamped archived item does on the launches after the discarded one), with an interleaved A/B/A (2.4.24/2.4.23/2.4.24) to close the thermal/order confound that sequential runs leave open.

Marks (n=10 medians) never regressed anywhere, agreeing with Step 1: overlay_open 139-155, overlay_close 146-158, sheet_alert_open 434-453, sheet_settings_open 368-392, sheet closes 206-214 across all four builds.

Harness findings: (1) the committed flows'' 3T points (540,974 / 540,1100 / 979,974) fall in inter-row gaps at every anchor''s layout (row pitch 150px, Dhuhr text y980-1045); each build''s four points were verified from the live tree (row and bell at y~1012, settings 539,1833) and driven from session-temp copies - the committed flows stay untouched, the settings-tap fix remains a later step''s. (2) An overlay-x10 run can end with the overlay open (a close tap that re-opens), and the next sheets flow then exits the app at its first BACK and measures nothing - force-stop and relaunch between flows (the README''s own gotcha) prevents it; two sheets runs were lost this way and reran clean. (3) A second Athan-family package on the 3T (<pkg>) emits ReactNativeJS logcat lines too; it pollutes captures but emits no PERF_MEASURE.

Device state tonight: no screen-sharing agent, battery 8 to 42 percent on USB charge throughout, phone unlocked, dev/mock env as Step 1. Evidence dirs (worktree-local, untracked): 2.4.11 overlay-open-000235, overlay-close-000300, sheet-alert-open-000324, sheet-settings-open-000346; 2.4.17 -231319, -231346, -231413, -231435; 2.4.23 -005239, -005300, -005328, -005350; 2.4.24 -012853, -012914, -012938, -013000. No repository changes were made; the lane branch stands at 2.4.25 (4ffd1f34).', NULL, '2026-10-25 00:43:23.098828+00', 'DFppJIU20ig1j5gFRYQIe541IkO7Itfp', NULL, NULL, '{}', '2026-10-25 05:37:10.055+00');
