INSERT INTO public.issue_activity (id, issue_id, kind, actor_name, body, action, created_at, actor_user_id, initiative_id, reply_to_id, payload, edited_at) VALUES (3434, 347, 'comment', 'owner', 'Blind review of 25b3adc0 (README rewrite + 2.4.41 bump). Verified every count, version, module and toggle against the tree; most claims hold (32 mp3s, 6+5 prayers, 6 locales, reminders 5-30, budget 64, expo ~58/RN 0.88/React 19/2.4.41, deploymentTarget 16.4, four modules, sheet screens, settings atoms, sweeps, ritual numbers, Duo lines carried verbatim, no device/person leaks).

FINDINGS

- defect: README.md line 18 (Languages) - "Arabic and Thai carry their own typefaces and native digits end to end". The digits half is false against the build: digits are Latin in every locale by pinned rule. shared/__tests__/dateLocalized.test.ts:64 asserts ar dates carry no Arabic-Indic digits and line 79 no Thai digits; shared/time.ts:288 "Latin digits in every locale (row 88)"; shared/typography.ts "Timer digits are Latin glyphs in every locale". The typeface half is true (ar -> Rubik, th -> Noto Sans Thai). Drop or reword "native digits end to end" (e.g. digits ride the locale''s own face).
- defect: README.md line 37 (Platforms and requirements) - "Android 9 and later". The build enforces no such floor: the shipped release APK reads minSdkVersion:''24'' (Android 7) via aapt2, and nothing tracked overrides it (react-native 0.88 gradle catalog minSdk = 24; the expo-build-properties block in app.json sets no minSdkVersion). Either reword to what the build carries, or the floor needs a minSdkVersion 28 pin in app.json (a code change beyond this docs commit).
- suggestion: README.md line 16 (Widgets) - "Home screen and Lock Screen widgets on iOS and Android". Lock Screen widgets are iOS-only: app.json carries "android": null on all six lock widgets, and widgets/LockPrayerWidget.tsx is a SwiftUI layout. The wording (carried from the previous README) reads as both kinds on both platforms; this rewrite''s mandate was exactly to clear stale leaves.', NULL, '2026-10-25 08:14:40.593411+00', 'DFppJIU20ig1j5gFRYQIe541IkO7Itfp', NULL, NULL, '{}', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.issue_activity (id, issue_id, kind, actor_name, body, action, created_at, actor_user_id, initiative_id, reply_to_id, payload, edited_at) VALUES (3435, 347, 'comment', 'owner', 'Audit of 88ad6ed8 passes: the languages line now matches the pinned Latin-digits rule with the three scripts'' typefaces named, the platforms line states the build''s true Android 7 floor (minSdk 24), the widgets line splits home (both platforms) from Lock Screen (iOS), the 2.4.42 bump passes the discipline gate as a docs patch, and the 2.4.41 twin with lane2/T-345 is allowlisted with the uniqueness gate green. Nothing new broke.', NULL, '2026-10-25 08:20:33.794632+00', 'DFppJIU20ig1j5gFRYQIe541IkO7Itfp', NULL, NULL, '{}', NULL);
