- nitpick: shared/whatsNew.ts around line 144 - the 1.13.0 debut sits between the 2.0.37 and 1.24.10 items, breaking the array''s otherwise newest-first reading order; nothing reads the raw order (getVisibleWhatsNew and groupWhatsNewItems both sort), so this is cosmetic only.
- Disclosure: my mutation probe raced the 08:48:50-08:49:26 rebase onto uat, and the briefly-committed 3b4a1c0a carried my 2.5.0 mutant as its debut stamp (a value from neither parent; my restore errored "path unmerged" mid-rebase). The 08:53:56 amend (acbd9c43) restored 1.13.0; I re-verified the amended head is green and its reviewed files are byte-identical to 3b0e7ab7.

