Planned against uat f97cd7d4 (2.4.17), which carries ticket 294''s colour-carried dim whole. The ticket''s planning note named 294''s conversion as the prime suspect for the reset ink and the doubled qibla line: verified. Both defects are `color: ''transparent''` on a Text — alpha-0 ink, which Android paints black. They are the only two alpha-0 text colours left in app/ and components/ (the settings sheet''s grabber and other named colours are opaque).

